{"time": 1758197892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "750665119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们答应之后，随着对疗养院的不断调查，你们发现除了怪物之外，这里还有一些身穿黄衣的奇怪的人类"}
{"time": 1758198023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1327622713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2095003895]（你记住了）"}
{"time": 1758198163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001041784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那群黄衣服的人自称为黄衣使徒，在一个叫做赞达鲁斯的人手下做事，他们本来都是疗养院的病人，但都被在赞达鲁斯的威逼利诱下加入了他的邪教，因为赞达鲁斯可以驱使一种叫做褴褛者的怪物，不服从他的人，褴褛者便会进入梦中杀死那些人，随后那些人便会变成僵尸或者变形怪"}
{"time": 1758198175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199695391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（你是用手写输入法的吗）"}
{"time": 1758198180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309397457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（我用脚打字都比你快）"}
{"time": 1758198204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506750745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（看了眼模组，有点忘了）"}
{"time": 1758198270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1676296042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "最后你们发现赞达鲁斯其实本身也只是一个普通的病人，但劳尔斯爵士对他进行了一些奇怪的治疗，随后他便能梦见一些奇怪的东西，并且你们惊讶的发现，自己好像之前在为劳尔斯爵士效力，但劳尔斯爵士以你们为筹码，交换了对赞达鲁斯的研究"}
{"time": 1758198298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439314473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=0BC9A3553B08242C42EA09C92004E029.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQxszU9oEeQwQEo2M0DfitbB9Dv2hjgrQIg_woou-Lph6fijwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ9R3vYQ4zSwxjsHOR219oI3oCXa6CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMGlQkca9QJtaWHGpe-l-08Lku4wzvmBrgNzBy6Tb2pzV917mAnyk6LdOzJ8UmYWP7Q,file_size=38624]"}
