{"time": 1759072106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133095099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“那很感谢了”"}
{"time": 1759072133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1056356112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...嗯。\""}
{"time": 1759072337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028277468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了对了，最近镇子上多了好多奇怪的人，不知道在捣鼓什么，不过镇子里的大家都说发生的怪事可能跟他们有关...我上次看见他们，他们是在码头搞什么，我记得你之前好像在码头有存什么，你们看到了也许可以回想起过去的记忆，但是码头可能会很危险，总之如果你们去的话一定要小心一点”"}
{"time": 1759072456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "3860792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"码头?\""}
{"time": 1759072551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1537016128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对的，马头”随后她具体告诉了你们东西藏在哪个木板下面"}
{"time": 1759073206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1066744755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "去看看"}
{"time": 1759073212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1176515572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们去看看，你呢\""}
{"time": 1759073445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1847086419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我还是不给你们添乱了...”她摆摆手“听说码头那边好像有什么怪物的样子最近，你们一定要小心点”"}
{"time": 1759073536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2057441076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“是僵尸吗”"}
