{"time": 1759841252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1183437279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "差不多一个月"}
{"time": 1759841307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "530828628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃，我不清楚是不是真的。\"合上日记，\"你们怎么看？\""}
{"time": 1759841383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717704527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“额……考虑到让我们来这里的就是格温，还是有点可疑的，这是谁的字，有人认出来吗？”"}
{"time": 1759841457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1408184018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "香风智乃觉得应该就是她的字迹"}
{"time": 1759841562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1273095277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "现在的时间差不多是黄昏，太阳在缓缓落下，很快就要天黑了"}
{"time": 1759841585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "348399512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“总之还是先把调查任务交了吧”"}
{"time": 1759841586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1430050493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好像是我的字。\"再翻一翻，\"但是她让我们来这里找我自己的笔记本?怎么感觉怪怪的\""}
{"time": 1759841605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501518123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "（我不知道你们怎么跟她谈的）"}
{"time": 1759841615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "823299956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(啥也没谈啊)"}
{"time": 1759841621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803376956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(她就让我们来码头)"}
{"time": 1759841674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991960632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:forward,id=7558462437696062562]"}
{"time": 1759841820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "292619938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“那晚点去拜访一下她吧，看起来她对我们的过去知道肯定不会少”"}
{"time": 1759841940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791332843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（力贼的命中好像有点烂）"}
{"time": 1759841951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1304631852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（不过感觉低命中你才知道这个是偷袭）"}
{"time": 1759841972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099347712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（那什么时候去马头）"}
{"time": 1759841984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214403285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你们都该从码头回来了）"}
{"time": 1759842033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2039965325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（我失忆了）"}
{"time": 1759842138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "598219654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（快rp吧）"}
{"time": 1759842147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152164102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（还有给动作（）"}
{"time": 1759842154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706163834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "*先去把那个德鲁伊相关的任务交了"}
{"time": 1759842198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "48272079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "收起东西，\"既然她愿意提供住处，待会不妨去看看\""}
{"time": 1759842399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1730480559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“我没意见”"}
{"time": 1759842444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128782696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那你们很快便回到了无眠机构，找到了负责人瑟莎蒂亚，也是这座城镇当下的管理人“你们这么快就处理好了吗，看样子之前温特说的是真的，所以说那个洞穴具体是什么情况”她看起来有些惊讶"}
{"time": 1759842520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143336280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"邪恶的女巫。\""}
{"time": 1759842525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125639379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "\"邪恶的女巫。\""}
{"time": 1759842542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "469704332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是棘石女巫？”"}
{"time": 1759842670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1534797633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "（报酬你们是谈好了的还是没谈？）"}
{"time": 1759842702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "134128771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=962499209]（1）"}
{"time": 1759842705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638593878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（3000）"}
{"time": 1759842725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1843015320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（但是我们调查回来了）"}
{"time": 1759842729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "694840705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（报酬给了吗）"}
{"time": 1759842788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1758153288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“大概没那么玄乎吧，那个女巫一看见我们就攻击”"}
{"time": 1759842803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "791996856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“也不知道她为啥要弄个发光的洞口，生怕人找不到她吗”"}
{"time": 1759842833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916349293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不清楚啦，感觉那女巫也就路边水平。\""}
{"time": 1759842836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868579946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（算在你们升级时候给的4k5里了，不过你们全都重训了）"}
{"time": 1759842851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "623449599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“她在准备一些让人失去意识的药剂，我觉得这件事背后还有更多的阴谋，你看要不要让我们接着调查吧”"}
{"time": 1759842893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1589007140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊？可以详细讲讲吗”"}
{"time": 1759842981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900030408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "（关于买药的人是谁，我们有线索吗？）"}
{"time": 1759842997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "27009831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "（另外药剂是已经交付还是还没有交付？我们有没有捡到样品？）"}
{"time": 1759843037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "424661899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（我们只看到了锅里的）"}
{"time": 1759843109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "137225346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1900030408]（有的，纸条上有名字（）[CQ:at,qq=1009793416]"}
{"time": 1759843111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2116303635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "（你们没弄点回来？）"}
{"time": 1759843114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64564177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "（没过知识？）"}
{"time": 1759843132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1829416256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（至于药水，是让人致幻的）"}
{"time": 1759843210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062064234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "（额…… 所以锅里的药水和纸条上的药水不是一个作用？）"}
{"time": 1759843243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153678534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是的）"}
{"time": 1759843368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785485880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“总之就是这个人在找她购买让人昏睡的药水，你看要不要让我们再去看看”"}
{"time": 1759843587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1857583745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“梅丽森？劳尔斯爵士走后，现在鸢尾庄园的管理者...果然是她吗，她确实挺可疑的，但我们一直没找到什么证据.....镇子上发生的怪事都是从劳尔斯爵士离开后发生的...”"}
{"time": 1759843640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2054502070", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是在你们调查鸢尾庄园前，可以先去冰流堡调查一下吗，镇上原来的政府机构，那里的治安官似乎失踪了，负责人也很久没有出现在大家的面前”"}
{"time": 1759843644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "446645537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说起来，我们当时给劳尔斯办事?\""}
{"time": 1759843652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "313075718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "*另外那个置换药剂是魔法药剂还是自然？"}
{"time": 1759843660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868688123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“我完全没有印象。”"}
{"time": 1759843696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710297840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是在你们调查鸢尾庄园前，可以先去冰流堡调查一下吗，镇上原来的政府机构，那里的治安官似乎失踪了，副官也很久没有出现在大家的面前”"}
{"time": 1759843716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "198697311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“怎么失踪了这么多人”"}
{"time": 1759843727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315326338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“那里面还有谁在吗？还是整个堡垒的人都不见了”"}
{"time": 1759843736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830153387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=446645537][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “是的，不过我对你们的了解也不太多，只知道你们以前对我的手下说过很过分的话”"}
{"time": 1759843745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804787932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“另外还有没有曾经在里面工作的人，我们可以见一见的”"}
{"time": 1759843847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1412925444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1315326338][CQ:at,qq=1009793416] “许多原本雇来捍卫这座堡垒的佣兵在没有拿到报酬后都开溜了，然后封闭了好几周，现在大家都不知道里面什么情况，之前皇家御史大人想要进去调查，但现在已经失去和她的联络了”"}
{"time": 1759843874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1475646125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃，所以我们现在也要进去看看?\""}
{"time": 1759843894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022892724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“所以这堡垒里工作的，现在一个人都找不到？”"}
{"time": 1759843909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1437170786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1022892724]“[CQ:at,qq=1009793416] 是这样的...”"}
{"time": 1759843934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723236987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以镇子上的人民才拜托我来暂时管理”"}
