{"time": 1759846514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "967214277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们也该去看看啦，这好像是挺有趣的事\""}
{"time": 1759846524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506064564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们几人吃了晚饭，然后前去格温的房子，时间差不多是八点多了，天已经彻底黑了下来，格温家的灯还是亮的"}
{"time": 1759846663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031713366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "敲敲门，\"格温?我回来了\""}
{"time": 1759846878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462865093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是谁？智乃吗？我这就来....”过了一会，格温打开了房门，看见你们很惊喜“快进来坐吧”"}
{"time": 1759846998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1497675814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“晚上好”"}
