{"time": 1760013226, "type": "reply", "message_id": "397143996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1760013285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1691434873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那么你们回去无眠机关休息了一晚上，第二天瑟莎蒂亚按照约定把短讯术卷轴给了你们"}
{"time": 1760013410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572278854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随后你们按照计划来到了冰流堡"}
{"time": 1760013435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229580536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "冰流堡建于瑟拉什摩爾的一座丘陵之上，整体是用石头搭建的，这里是治安官的办公场所，而且还附带一个小的军营以保护此地。"}
{"time": 1760013470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1730600008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=CF3375F933831391CE5147DF2738F0B0.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQzK09icDAacrRO182ogW9kzEFIUxjCohEg_woogdPxjJGXkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ-GYHw7nue2EJJ6TUrrHu0noC0gGCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMIvUO7JEe7qqFniesYt272sLPgPOqVFOP_JmFm_xW1ooidhlyOYAIwTCB3MwBCv0iw,file_size=282946]堡垒的唯一入口是一面高10尺的大门，这位于这座石制建筑的南边。门上挂着的镂空黄铜门环雕刻着一只鸟儿在其上栖息的纹样。用于窥探用的射孔死死地紧闭着"}
{"time": 1760013478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1723045332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你们可以动了）"}
{"time": 1760013548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "356702214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“要敲门吗”"}
{"time": 1760013555, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402666722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我觉得可以\""}
